\paragraph{External computation.} None; symbolic arguments and boundary checks only.
\section{Scope and remaining gaps}
This proves a precise restricted identifiability fact and a counterexample to unrestricted single-knockout sufficiency. The original question's biological dynamics, experimental noise, and model selection criterion remain unspecified.
